# CANONICAL COPY — belongs at the ROOT of the kernel checkout, as `.dockerignore`.
#
#   cp images/cow-solver/kernel.dockerignore "$SOLVER_KERNEL_SRC/.dockerignore"
#
# It lives here, and has to be copied, because the kernel repo GITIGNORES
# `.dockerignore` on purpose (alongside `docker/` and `docker-compose.yml`) —
# docker artifacts are deliberately not committed there. So a fresh kernel
# clone will not have it, and the cow-solver image build would ship 1.7 GB of
# node_modules as build context instead of ~14 MB.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

node_modules
**/node_modules

.git
.github

# Local build/tooling caches
.compact-cache
.cache
dist
build

# Local state and noise
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.mainnet.example
